[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12002.87, "timestamp": "03:20:02", "text": "呃，它是拧不开的，我希望，我相信。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12006.15, "timestamp": "03:20:06", "text": "但是，是的，所以，呃，我真的很需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12009.91, "timestamp": "03:20:09", "text": "像手机一样小的螺丝刀"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12012.469, "timestamp": "03:20:12", "text": "那种东西。它真的很小"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12015.429, "timestamp": "03:20:15", "text": "螺丝刀。不，是螺丝钉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12018.71, "timestamp": "03:20:18", "text": "拧下显卡（GPU）的螺丝"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12021.269, "timestamp": "03:20:21", "text": "风扇之类的东西。是的，我当时非常苦恼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12025.67, "timestamp": "03:20:25", "text": "就这样，我出去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12028.389, "timestamp": "03:20:28", "text": "到处都找过了，但已经像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12033.99, "timestamp": "03:20:33", "text": "下午5点5分6秒这里。所以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12038.389, "timestamp": "03:20:38", "text": "虽然很悲伤，确实会很痛苦，但是，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12041.429, "timestamp": "03:20:41", "text": "虽然很遗憾"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12043.51, "timestamp": "03:20:43", "text": "是的，我到处都找不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12046.07, "timestamp": "03:20:46", "text": "它和每个人，我每家店都说过他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12050.389, "timestamp": "03:20:50", "text": "他说明天早上来，我就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12053.59, "timestamp": "03:20:53", "text": "但是，是的，但是我们仍然在讨论这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12055.99, "timestamp": "03:20:55", "text": "无需赘言，我们走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12058.55, "timestamp": "03:20:58", "text": "这是有史以来第一次通过直播进行直播。"}]